//! The grammar's rules as tables. Generated by `oracle/haskell-grammar.ts` from
//! the `haskell` grammar Shiki 4.6.0 bundles; do not edit.
//!
//! A [`Pattern`] is one regular expression of the grammar; its doc comment
//! shows which.
//! Each rule lists the patterns it tries, in the grammar's order with its
//! `include`s flattened.
//! So the first that matches at the earliest position wins, as in a
//! `TextMate` engine.

